\pard\plain \tx960\fi960\sl360\slmult1\ltrch\loch {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Project Serva Mission Goal and principles set out in the book to change the way people think toward technological advancement. }
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Currently we live in an age where capitalism while it has it\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92s benefits to a productive society based on perfection and a competitive nature. The current model is prone a weaknesses where resources both human and material are overlooked for there temporary inefficiency and replaced with the next best selling model, instead of an innovative conservative approach. Consumerism and profit is rife within the community. Virtues based on instant gratification and validation models to up sell status for a price, while corruption runs rampart within governing bodies and minorities struggle silently in overlooked unthought of parts of the world to attain life\u8217\'92s basic requirements of sustenance. }
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 There are several facets to the formation of Serva Vitae. }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 1.\tab  }{\f2\fs24\b1\i0 A conscious peaceful mind in an age where technology can be used for wrong or right.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Based on teachings from the Dalai Lama and Buddhist virtues. Serva Vitae presents a holistic approach of empathetic }{\f2\fs24\b1\i0 calculated }{\f1\fs24\b0\i0 technology in dealing with situations of turmoil. This is portrayed through the integration of fail safes in technology to preserve and disarm situations that could otherwise end in loss of life, and eventually the integration of such technology into a sentient platform that assesses situations based on the combination of coded principles, ethics and efficient resource distribution. }
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 2. }{\f2\fs24\b1\i0 A new economy that promotes prosperous societies and deters corruption}{\f1\fs24\b0\i0  }{\f2\fs24\b1\i0 through}{\f1\fs24\b0\i0  }{\f2\fs24\b1\i0 transparency}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Social inequality to quash extreme indifference and conflict between groups and leaders. This is achieved through an improved AI influenced blockchain economy which automatically allocates and distributes resources based on a model that is maintained by what are referred to as Technocrats. }
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 3 }{\f2\fs24\b1\i0 A new neurological correctional technology designed by the sentient to retrain erratic minds which have been subject to traumatic experience.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 This technology is presented by the sentient in a scene where one of the main characters Tex is unable to use the Jump {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://8E10A646-F936-412E-94E3-BC45D1BBBB8B"}{\fldrsltgates}} to to his aggressive and traumatic history. In a scene where the Beverly is approaching the {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://4287F4CD-8A53-4380-9F34-F9597BD0DCF9"}{\fldrsltgate}} the ship cannot jump into the gravity assist (Space transportation {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://18A82B71-5430-4205-B43A-FC3777529D15"}{\fldrsltgate}}) due to the irratic mental state based on his traumatic history and consequential nature. Through this corrective state which equips him with a new more pragmatic approach to conflict resolution, Tex is then able to jump normally with his team through the {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://C89B05B2-E457-4915-B672-B8D107221008"}{\fldrsltgates}} to other sectors. }
